5. Improved the mocking structure to be more reliable
6. Removed direct dependency on the actual page component that was causing the fetch error
7. Added proper type safety with React imports

The changes should resolve the "Failed to fetch dynamically imported module" error by:
1. Avoiding the problematic dynamic import
2. Providing all necessary mock implementations
3. Handling async operations with Suspense
